  "core": "Reciprocity moves what was given back into circulation — stored kindness, old debts, the weight of what passed between people finding its way home. In Source, it works at the threshold where one cycle ends and the next begins to pull. Here, exchange is not repair but fuel: what flows between beings enters the opening and feeds whatever is about to form. The returning gift becomes the first material of what comes next.",
